</span><span begin="2:25:02.660" end="2:25:02.960" podcasts:unit="word">sky,</span><span begin="2:25:02.960" end="2:25:03.180" podcasts:unit="word">maybe</span><span begin="2:25:03.180" end="2:25:04.860" podcasts:unit="word">not</span><span begin="2:25:04.860" end="2:25:05.960" podcasts:unit="word">disappeared.</span></span><span begin="2:25:05.960" end="2:25:12.280" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:25:05.960" end="2:25:06.100" podcasts:unit="word">But</span><span begin="2:25:06.100" end="2:25:06.260" podcasts:unit="word">all</span><span begin="2:25:06.260" end="2:25:06.420" podcasts:unit="word">these</span><span begin="2:25:06.420" end="2:25:06.640" podcasts:unit="word">things,</span><span begin="2:25:06.640" end="2:25:06.760" podcasts:unit="word">I'm</span><span begin="2:25:06.760" end="2:25:06.900" podcasts:unit="word">just</span><span begin="2:25:06.900" end="2:25:07.140" podcasts:unit="word">saying,</span><span begin="2:25:07.280" end="2:25:07.700" podcasts:unit="word">whatever</span><span begin="2:25:07.700" end="2:25:07.920" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:25:07.920" end="2:25:08.300" podcasts:unit="word">actually</span><span begin="2:25:08.300" end="2:25:09.340" podcasts:unit="word">were,</span><span begin="2:25:09.340" end="2:25:09.780" podcasts:unit="word">certainly</span><span begin="2:25:09.780" end="2:25:10.220" podcasts:unit="word">continued</span><span begin="2:25:10.220" end="2:25:10.280" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:25:10.280" end="2:25:10.620" podcasts:unit="word">increase</span><span begin="2:25:10.620" end="2:25:10.780" podcasts:unit="word">my</span><span begin="2:25:10.780" end="2:25:12.280" podcasts:unit="word">interest.</span></span><span begin="2:25:12.280" end="2:25:15.060" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:25:12.280" end="2:25:12.420" podcasts:unit="word">And</span><span begin="2:25:12.420" end="2:25:12.540" podcasts:unit="word">I've</span><span begin="2:25:12.540" end=