60" end="2:25:23.140" podcasts:unit="word">when</span><span begin="2:25:23.140" end="2:25:23.220" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="2:25:23.220" end="2:25:23.340" podcasts:unit="word">were</span><span begin="2:25:23.340" end="2:25:23.420" podcasts:unit="word">a</span><span begin="2:25:23.420" end="2:25:23.880" podcasts:unit="word">child?</span></span><span begin="2:25:24.000" end="2:25:27.400" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:25:24.000" end="2:25:24.180" podcasts:unit="word">And</span><span begin="2:25:24.180" end="2:25:24.320" podcasts:unit="word">did</span><span begin="2:25:24.320" end="2:25:24.560" podcasts:unit="word">those</span><span begin="2:25:24.560" end="2:25:24.700" podcasts:unit="word">kind</span><span begin="2:25:24.700" end="2:25:24.920" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:25:24.920" end="2:25:25.420" podcasts:unit="word">counteract</span><span begin="2:25:25.420" end="2:25:25.560" podcasts:unit="word">each</span><span begin="2:25:25.560" end="2:25:25.760" podcasts:unit="word">other</span><span begin="2:25:25.760" end="2:25:25.860" podcasts:unit="word">at</span><span begin="2:25:25.860" end="2:25:27.400" podcasts:unit="word">all?</span></span></p><p begin="2:25:27.400" end="2:27:08.240" ttm:agent="SPEAKER_3"><span begin="2:25:27.400" end="2:25:42.300" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:25:27.400" end="2:25:27.800" podcasts:unit="word">Well,</span><span begin="2:25:27.800" end="2:25:28.040" podcasts:unit="word">yeah,</span><span begin="2:25:28.500" end="2:25:28.620" podcasts:unit="word">I</span><span begin="2:25:28.620" end="2:25:28.740" podcasts:unit="word">was</span><span begin="2:25:28.740" end="2:25:29.000" podcasts:unit="word">raised</span><span begin="2:25:29.000" end="2:25:29.120" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:25:29.120" end="2:25:29.260" podcasts:unit="word">a</span><span begin="2:25:29.260" end="2:25:29.980" podcasts:unit="word">Presbyterian</span><span begin="2:25:29.980