:45.220" podcasts:unit="word">God,</span><span begin="2:45:45.220" end="2:45:45.420" podcasts:unit="word">for</span><span begin="2:45:45.420" end="2:45:45.800" podcasts:unit="word">angels</span><span begin="2:45:45.800" end="2:45:45.940" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:45:45.940" end="2:45:46.380" podcasts:unit="word">demons,</span><span begin="2:45:46.380" end="2:45:49.700" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:45:49.700" end="2:45:50.060" podcasts:unit="word">so-called</span><span begin="2:45:50.060" end="2:45:50.520" podcasts:unit="word">paranormal</span><span begin="2:45:50.520" end="2:45:51.400" podcasts:unit="word">phenomena</span><span begin="2:45:51.400" end="2:45:51.520" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:45:51.520" end="2:45:51.640" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:45:51.640" end="2:45:52.320" podcasts:unit="word">understand</span><span begin="2:45:52.320" end="2:45:52.460" podcasts:unit="word">is</span><span begin="2:45:52.460" end="2:45:52.740" podcasts:unit="word">something</span><span begin="2:45:52.740" end="2:45:52.900" podcasts:unit="word">from</span><span begin="2:45:52.900" end="2:45:54.280" podcasts:unit="word">God,</span><span begin="2:45:54.320" end="2:45:54.400" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:45:54.400" end="2:45:54.480" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="2:45:54.480" end="2:45:54.580" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:45:54.580" end="2:45:54.780" podcasts:unit="word">what</span><span begin="2:45:54.780" end="2:45:55.100" podcasts:unit="word">happens</span><span begin="2:45:55.100" end="2:45:55.360" podcasts:unit="word">unless</span><span begin="2:45:55.360" end="2:45:55.580" podcasts:unit="word">it's</span><span begin="2:45:55.580" end="2:45:56.400" podcasts:unit="word">demonic.</span></span><span begin="2:45:56.400" end="2:45:59.220" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:45:56.400" end="2:45:58.200" podcasts:unit="word">But,</span><span begin=