" end="2:58:56.540" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:58:56.540" end="2:58:56.780" podcasts:unit="word">human</span><span begin="2:58:56.780" end="2:58:57.000" podcasts:unit="word">race</span><span begin="2:58:57.000" end="2:58:57.180" podcasts:unit="word">was</span><span begin="2:58:57.180" end="2:58:58.160" podcasts:unit="word">created,</span><span begin="2:58:58.160" end="2:58:58.380" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:58:58.380" end="2:58:58.620" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:58:58.620" end="2:58:58.800" podcasts:unit="word">some</span><span begin="2:58:58.800" end="2:58:58.900" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:58:58.900" end="2:58:59.160" podcasts:unit="word">them</span><span begin="2:58:59.160" end="2:58:59.420" podcasts:unit="word">turned</span><span begin="2:58:59.420" end="2:58:59.720" podcasts:unit="word">against</span><span begin="2:58:59.720" end="2:59:00.060" podcasts:unit="word">God,</span><span begin="2:59:00.060" end="2:59:00.160" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:00.160" end="2:59:00.740" podcasts:unit="word">rebellion,</span><span begin="2:59:00.740" end="2:59:01.260" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:01.260" end="2:59:01.420" podcasts:unit="word">then</span><span begin="2:59:01.420" end="2:59:01.780" podcasts:unit="word">became</span><span begin="2:59:01.780" end="2:59:02.220" podcasts:unit="word">corrupted</span><span begin="2:59:02.220" end="2:59:02.340" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:03.680" end="2:59:04.040" podcasts:unit="word">their</span><span begin="2:59:04.040" end="2:59:04.280" podcasts:unit="word">mind</span><span begin="2:59:04.280" end="2:59:04.400" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:04.400" end="2:59:05.260" podcasts:unit="word">will.</span></span><span begin="2:59:06.600" end="2:59:18.140" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:06.600" end="2:59:06.780" podcasts:unit="word">And</span><span begin="2:59:06.780" end="2:59:06.940" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:06.940" end="2:59:07.100" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:07.100" end="2:59:07.880" podcasts:unit="word">are</span><span begin="2:59:07.880" end="2:59:08.120" podcasts:unit="word">still</span><span begin="2:59:08.120" end="2:59:08.420" podcasts:unit="word">allowed</span><span begin="2:59:08.420" end="2:59:08.560" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:08.560" end="2:59:08.780" podcasts:unit="word">roam,</span><span begin="2:59:08.780" end="2:59:08.860" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:08.860" end="2:59:09.120" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:09.120" end="2:59:09.280" podcasts:unit="word">come</span><span begin="2:59:09.280" end="2:59:09.380" podcasts:unit="word">on</span><span begin="2:59:09.380" end="2:59:09.620" podcasts:unit="word">earth,</span><span begin="2:59:09.620" end="2:59:09.760" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:09.940" end="2:59:10.160" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:10.160" end="2:59:10.380" podcasts:unit="word">hate</span><span begin="2:59:10.380" end="2:59:10.640" podcasts:unit="word">us</span><span begin="2:59:10.640" end="2:59:11.000" podcasts:unit="word">because</span><span begin="2:59:11.000" end="2:59:11.880" podcasts:unit="word">we're</span><span begin="2:59:11.880" end="2:59:12.080" podcasts:unit="word">sons</span><span begin="2:59:12.080" end="2:59:12.200" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:12.200" end="2:59:12.500" podcasts:unit="word">daughters</span><span begin="2:59:12.500" end="2:59:12.620" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:12.620" end="2:59:13.060" podcasts:unit="word">God,</span><span begin="2:59:13.060" end="2:59:13.220" podcasts:unit="word">we're</span><span begin="2:59:13.220" end="2:59:13.280" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:13.280" end="2:59:13.380" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:13.380" end="2:59:13.580" podcasts:unit="word">image</span><span begin="2:59:13.580" end="2:59:13.680" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:13.680" end="2:59:13.900" podcasts:unit="word">God,</span><span begin="2:59:13.900" end="2:59:14.000" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:14.000" end="2:59:14.100" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:14.100" end="2:59:14.220" podcasts:unit="word">want</span><span begin="2:59:14.220" end="2:59:14.300" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:14.300" end="2:59:14.740" podcasts:unit="word">deface</span><span begin="2:59:14.740" end="2:59:14.920" podcasts:unit="word">us,</span><span begin="2:59:15.020" end="2:59:15.140" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:15.140" end="2:59:15.280" podcasts:unit="word">want</span><span begin="2:59:15.280" end="2:59:16.320" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:16.320" end="2:59:16.500" podcasts:unit="word">bring</span><span begin="2:59:16.500" end="2:59:16.620" podcasts:unit="word">us</span><span begin="2:59:16.620" end="2:59:16.720" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:16.720" end="2:59:16.900" podcasts:unit="word">hell</span><span begin="2:59:16.900" end="2:59:17.000" podcasts:unit="word">with</span><span begin="2:59:17.000" end="2:59:18.140" podcasts:unit="word">themselves.</span></span><span begin="2:59:18.140" end="2:59:22.820" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:18.140" end="2:59:18.380" podcasts:unit="word">And</span><span begin="2:59:20.260" end="2:59:20.420" podcasts:unit="word">so,</span><span begin="2:59:20.880" end="2:59:21.000" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:21.000" end="2:59:21.100" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:21.100" end="2:59:21.340" podcasts:unit="word">Catholic</span><span begin="2:59:21.340" end="2:59:21.620" podcasts:unit="word">tradition</span><span begin="2:59:21.620" end="2:59:21.820" podcasts:unit="word">anyway,</span><span begin="2:59:21.820" end="2:59:21.940" podcasts:unit="word">it's</span><span begin="2:59:21.940" end="2:59:22.180" podcasts:unit="word">very</span><span begin="2:59:22.180" end="2:59:22.400" podcasts:unit="word">clear</span><span begin="2:59:22.400" end="2:59:22.540" podcasts:unit="word">what</span><span begin="2:59:22.540" end="2:59:22.680" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:22.680" end="2:59:22.820" podcasts:unit="word">are.</span></span><span begin="2:59:23.280" end="2:59:35.420" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:23.280" end="2:59:23.460" podcasts:unit="word">We</span><span begin="2:59:23.460" end="2:59:23.620" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:23.620" end="2:59:23.740" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:23.740" end="2:59:23.840" podcasts:unit="word">had</span><span begin="2:59:23.840" end="2:59:23.920" podcasts:unit="word">a</span><span begin="2:59:23.920" end="2:59:25.280" podcasts:unit="word">beginning,</span><span begin="2:59:25.280" end="2:59:25.420" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:59:25.420" end="2:59:25.640" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:25.640" end="2:59:26.600" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:26.620" end="2:59:26.760" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="2:59:26.760" end="2:59:26.880" podcasts:unit="word">have</span><span begin="2:59:26.880" end="2:59:27.020" podcasts:unit="word">good</span><span begin="2:59:27.020" end="2:59:27.140" podcasts:unit="word">ones</span><span begin="2:59:27.140" end="2:59:27.240" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:27.240" end="2:59:27.400" podcasts:unit="word">ones</span><span begin="2:59:27.400" end="2:59:27.520" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:27.520" end="2:59:27.640" podcasts:unit="word">have</span><span begin="2:59:27.640" end="2:59:27.960" podcasts:unit="word">fallen,</span><span begin="2:59:27.960" end="2:59:28.080" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:59:28.080" end="2:59:28.260" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:28.260" end="2:59:29.120" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:29.120" end="2:59:29.300" podcasts:unit="word">they're</span><span begin="2:59:29.300" end="2:59:30.640" podcasts:unit="word">non-caporial,</span><span begin="2:59:30.640" end="2:59:30.840" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:30.840" end="2:59:31.080" podcasts:unit="word">don't</span><span begin="2:59:31.080" end="2:59:31.280" podcasts:unit="word">move</span><span begin="2:59:31.280" end="2:59:31.480" podcasts:unit="word">through</span><span begin="2:59:31.480" end="2:59:31.820" podcasts:unit="word">space,</span><span begin="2:59:31.820" end="2:59:31.940" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:31.940" end="2:59:32.100" podcasts:unit="word">don't</span><span begin="2:59:32.100" end="2:59:32.280" podcasts:unit="word">have</span><span begin="2:59:32.280" end="2:59:32.600" podcasts:unit="word">bodies</span><span begin="2:59:32.600" end="2:59:32.720" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:32.720" end="2:59:32.840" podcasts:unit="word">way</span><span begin="2:59:32.840" end="2:59:33.020" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:59:33.020" end="2:59:33.740" podcasts:unit="word">do,</span><span begin="2:59:33.740" end="2:59:33.880" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:33.880" end="2:59:34.080" podcasts:unit="word">pure</span><span begin="2:59:34.080" end="2:59:35.420" podcasts:unit="word">spirit.</span></span><span begin="2:59:35.420" end="2:59:39.960" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:35.420" end="2:59:35.540" podcasts:unit="word">We</span><span begin="2:59:35.540" end="2:59:35.740" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:35.740" end="2:59:35.980" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:35.980" end="2:59:36.900" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:36.900" end="2:59:37.080" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:37.080" end="2:59:37.140" podcasts:unit="word">a</span><span begin="2:59:37.140" end="2:59:37.280" podcasts:unit="word">whole</span><span begin="2:59:37.280" end="2:59:37.440" podcasts:unit="word">lot</span><span begin="2:59:37.440" end="2:59:37.620" podcasts:unit="word">more</span><span begin="2:59:37.620" end="2:59:37.740" podcasts:unit="word">than</span><span begin="2:59:37.740" end="2:59:37.880" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:59:37.880" end="2:59:38.040" podcasts:unit="word">do,</span><span begin="2:59:38.040" end="2:59:38.220" podcasts:unit="word">they've</span><span begin="2:59:38.220" end="2:59:38.640" podcasts:unit="word">got</span><span begin="2:59:38.640" end="2:59:38.860" podcasts:unit="word">gifts</span><span begin="2:59:38.860" end="2:59:39.000" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:39.000" end="2:59:39.380" podcasts:unit="word">powers</span><span begin="2:59:39.380" end="2:59:39.780" podcasts:unit="word">beyond</span><span begin="2:59:39.780" end="2:59:39.960" podcasts:unit="word">us.</span></span><span begin="2:59:40.640" end="2:59:46.100" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:40.640" end="2:59:40.720" podcasts:unit="word">We</span><span begin="2:59:40.720" end="2:59:40.940" podcasts:unit="word">know</span><span begin="2:59:40.940" end="2:59:43.860" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:43.860" end="2:59:44.020" podcasts:unit="word">they</span><span begin="2:59:44.020" end="2:59:44.220" podcasts:unit="word">do</span><span begin="2:59:44.220" end="2:59:44.360" podcasts:unit="word">get</span><span begin="2:59:44.360" end="2:59:44.980" podcasts:unit="word">involved</span><span begin="2:59:44.980" end="2:59:45.160" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:45.160" end="2:59:45.420" podcasts:unit="word">things</span><span begin="2:59:45.420" end="2:59:45.560" podcasts:unit="word">on</span><span begin="2:59:45.560" end="2:59:46.100" podcasts:unit="word">Earth.</span></span><span begin="2:59:46.100" end="2:59:52.440" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:46.100" end="2:59:46.240" podcasts:unit="word">But</span><span begin="2:59:46.240" end="2:59:46.340" podcasts:unit="word">we</span><span begin="2:59:46.340" end="2:59:46.660" podcasts:unit="word">also</span><span begin="2:59:46.660" end="2:59:46.880" podcasts:unit="word">know,</span><span begin="2:59:46.880" end="2:59:47.100" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="2:59:47.100" end="2:59:47.320" podcasts:unit="word">it's</span><span begin="2:59:47.320" end="2:59:47.460" podcasts:unit="word">part</span><span begin="2:59:47.460" end="2:59:47.540" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:47.540" end="2:59:47.680" podcasts:unit="word">our</span><span begin="2:59:47.680" end="2:59:48.080" podcasts:unit="word">faith,</span><span begin="2:59:48.080" end="2:59:48.360" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:48.360" end="2:59:48.480" podcasts:unit="word">one</span><span begin="2:59:48.480" end="2:59:48.560" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:48.560" end="2:59:48.680" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:48.680" end="2:59:49.000" podcasts:unit="word">things</span><span begin="2:59:49.000" end="2:59:49.220" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="2:59:49.220" end="2:59:49.520" podcasts:unit="word">Jesus</span><span begin="2:59:49.520" end="2:59:49.820" podcasts:unit="word">Christ</span><span begin="2:59:49.820" end="2:59:50.040" podcasts:unit="word">came</span><span begin="2:59:50.040" end="2:59:50.140" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:50.140" end="2:59:50.840" podcasts:unit="word">do</span><span begin="2:59:50.840" end="2:59:51.780" podcasts:unit="word">was</span><span begin="2:59:51.780" end="2:59:51.920" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:51.920" end="2:59:52.240" podcasts:unit="word">conquer</span><span begin="2:59:52.240" end="2:59:52.440" podcasts:unit="word">that.</span></span><span begin="2:59:52.440" end="2:59:56.020" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:52.440" end="2:59:52.560" podcasts:unit="word">He</span><span begin="2:59:52.560" end="2:59:52.740" podcasts:unit="word">has</span><span begin="2:59:52.740" end="2:59:53.200" podcasts:unit="word">authority</span><span begin="2:59:53.440" end="2:59:53.660" podcasts:unit="word">as</span><span begin="2:59:53.660" end="2:59:53.840" podcasts:unit="word">God</span><span begin="2:59:53.840" end="2:59:53.900" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="2:59:53.900" end="2:59:54.060" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:54.060" end="2:59:54.300" podcasts:unit="word">flesh,</span><span begin="2:59:54.300" end="2:59:54.400" podcasts:unit="word">he</span><span begin="2:59:54.400" end="2:59:54.520" podcasts:unit="word">has</span><span begin="2:59:54.520" end="2:59:54.920" podcasts:unit="word">authority</span><span begin="2:59:54.920" end="2:59:55.120" podcasts:unit="word">over</span><span begin="2:59:55.120" end="2:59:56.020" podcasts:unit="word">them.</span></span><span begin="2:59:56.020" end="3:00:06.420" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="2:59:56.020" end="2:59:56.200" podcasts:unit="word">That's</span><span begin="2:59:56.200" end="2:59:56.320" podcasts:unit="word">one</span><span begin="2:59:56.320" end="2:59:56.380" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:56.380" end="2:59:56.500" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:56.500" end="2:59:57.020" podcasts:unit="word">things,</span><span begin="2:59:57.020" end="2:59:57.100" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="2:59:57.100" end="2:59:57.380" podcasts:unit="word">Catholic</span><span begin="2:59:57.380" end="2:59:57.780" podcasts:unit="word">tradition</span><span begin="2:59:57.780" end="2:59:57.900" podcasts:unit="word">when</span><span begin="2:59:57.900" end="2:59:59.060" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="2:59:59.060" end="2:59:59.300" podcasts:unit="word">begin</span><span begin="2:59:59.300" end="2:59:59.400" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="2:59:59.400" end="2:59:59.600" podcasts:unit="word">bump</span><span begin="2:59:59.600" end="2:59:59.760" podcasts:unit="word">up</span><span begin="2:59:59.760" end="2:59:59.860" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="2:59:59.860" end="3:00:00.120" podcasts:unit="word">these</span><span begin="3:00:00.120" end="3:00:00.960" podcasts:unit="word">things</span><span begin="3:00:00.960" end="3:00:01.180" podcasts:unit="word">that</span><span begin="3:00:02.460" end="3:00:02.620" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="3:00:02.620" end="3:00:02.780" podcasts:unit="word">can</span><span begin="3:00:02.780" end="3:00:03.000" podcasts:unit="word">make</span><span begin="3:00:03.000" end="3:00:03.220" podcasts:unit="word">use</span><span begin="3:00:03.220" end="3:00:03.340" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="3:00:03.340" end="3:00:03.960" podcasts:unit="word">that,</span><span begin="3:00:04.200" end="3:00:04.380" podcasts:unit="word">to</span><span begin="3:00:04.380" end="3:00:04.640" podcasts:unit="word">find</span><span begin="3:00:04.640" end="3:00:04.780" podcasts:unit="word">out</span><span begin="3:00:04.780" end="3:00:05.060" podcasts:unit="word">whether</span><span begin="3:00:05.060" end="3:00:05.400" podcasts:unit="word">something</span><span begin="3:00:05.400" end="3:00:05.540" podcasts:unit="word">is</span><span begin="3:00:05.540" end="3:00:05.920" podcasts:unit="word">demonic</span><span begin="3:00:05.920" end="3:00:06.020" podcasts:unit="word">or</span><span begin="3:00:06.020" end="3:00:06.420" podcasts:unit="word">not.</span></span><span begin="3:00:06.420" end="3:00:32.360" podcasts:unit="sentence" xml:lang="en"><span begin="3:00:06.420" end="3:00:06.580" podcasts:unit="word">If</span><span begin="3:00:08.080" end="3:00:08.240" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="3:00:08.240" end="3:00:08.380" podcasts:unit="word">have</span><span begin="3:00:08.380" end="3:00:08.460" podcasts:unit="word">an</span><span begin="3:00:08.460" end="3:00:08.840" podcasts:unit="word">experience</span><span begin="3:00:08.840" end="3:00:09.060" podcasts:unit="word">like</span><span begin="3:00:09.060" end="3:00:09.280" podcasts:unit="word">that,</span><span begin="3:00:09.420" end="3:00:09.500" podcasts:unit="word">you</span><span begin="3:00:09.500" end="3:00:10.940" podcasts:unit="word">can,</span><span begin="3:00:11.340" end="3:00:11.680" podcasts:unit="word">again,</span><span begin="3:00:11.680" end="3:00:11.820" podcasts:unit="word">I've</span><span begin="3:00:11.820" end="3:00:11.960" podcasts:unit="word">been</span><span begin="3:00:11.960" end="3:00:12.100" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="3:00:12.100" end="3:00:13.980" podcasts:unit="word">fault</span><span begin="3:00:13.980" end="3:00:14.120" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="3:00:14.120" end="3:00:14.900" podcasts:unit="word">exorcisms,</span><span begin="3:00:14.900" end="3:00:15.100" podcasts:unit="word">I've</span><span begin="3:00:15.100" end="3:00:15.380" podcasts:unit="word">been</span><span begin="3:00:15.380" end="3:00:16.080" podcasts:unit="word">consulted</span><span begin="3:00:16.080" end="3:00:16.300" podcasts:unit="word">in</span><span begin="3:00:16.300" end="3:00:16.700" podcasts:unit="word">cases</span><span begin="3:00:16.700" end="3:00:16.800" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="3:00:16.800" end="3:00:17.940" podcasts:unit="word">debilical</span><span begin="3:00:17.940" end="3:00:19.480" podcasts:unit="word">possession,</span><span begin="3:00:21.560" end="3:00:21.760" podcasts:unit="word">and</span><span begin="3:00:22.080" end="3:00:22.280" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="3:00:22.280" end="3:00:22.760" podcasts:unit="word">sacraments</span><span begin="3:00:22.760" end="3:00:22.860" podcasts:unit="word">of</span><span begin="3:00:22.860" end="3:00:22.980" podcasts:unit="word">the</span><span begin="3:00:22.980" end="3:00:23.380" podcasts:unit="word">church,</span><spa